TRANSLATION:
Hey Büyük Patron,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}} bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}polis karakolu{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yaptırsak ne dersin, hem de {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a?
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Polis memurları,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} gerçek hayattaki süper
kahramanlar{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} gibi; bir de kayıp
eşyaları saklıyorlar!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a gelen ziyaretçileri takip
eden polislerin olması da güzel olurdu!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Başkan sensin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, son söz senin,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ama bunu düşüneceğine söz verir misin?{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

DE:
Weißt du eigentlich,{{TAG:0003:0017:}} was
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
für tolle Vorteile hätte?
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0400650072000600730069006500040065007300}} würde die Beliebtheit unserer
Stadt um 347 % erhöhen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Na ja, vielleicht auch nur um 342 %.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Auf jeden Fall wär es toll!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Denk mal
darüber nach, ja?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich sag dann schon mal {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Melinda
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Bescheid,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

EN:
Hey, I had an idea.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}How about
commissioning {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} in town?!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I'm sure everyone would love it.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Including you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Will you think about it? Please?{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

FR:
Dis,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}et si on faisait installer {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} dans notre
ville, hein ?!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Je suis sûr que tout le monde
aimerait ça.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Même toi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tu vas y réfléchir ? Allez... Dis oui...{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

TRANSLATION:
Hey, aklıma bir fikir geldi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}Kasabada
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} yaptırsak nasıl olur?!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Eminim herkes bayılır.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sen de dahil, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir düşünür müsün? Lütfen?{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

EN:
Last night, I dreamed there was{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} in town.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Now I can't stop thinking about it{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, would it be possible
to make my dream come true?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Promise me you'll consider it.
While you're thinking it over,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I'll tell
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Isabelle {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}about it.{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

ES:
Anoche soñé que en el pueblo había{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
algo nuevo: ¡teníamos nuestr{{TAG:000E:0012:130002006F00020061000000}}
propi{{TAG:000E:0012:130002006F00020061000000}} {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Ahora no se me quita de la cabeza{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, ¿sería posible
hacer realidad mi sueño?
Prométeme que te lo pensarás.
Y mientras te lo piensas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} se lo
contaré también a {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Canela{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

FR:
Cette nuit, j'ai rêvé qu'on avait {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} en ville.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Depuis, je n'arrête pas d'y penser.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Alors, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, tu crois que ce
serait possible de réaliser ce rêve ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Promets-moi au moins d'y réfléchir.
Et pendant que tu y penses,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} je vais
en parler à {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Marie{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

IT:
Stanotte ho sognato che in città
c'era{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}E adesso non penso più ad altro{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Allora, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, si potrebbe
far avverare il mio sogno?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Promettimi che ci penserai su.
Mentre rifletti sul da farsi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ne parlerò con {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fuffi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:000D:0000:06CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Dün televizyonda{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} şahane bir {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
